problem:
There exists a unique sequence of positive integers \(a_1, a_2, a_3, \ldots, a_{2023}\) such that
\[a_1 = 1, \quad a_{n+1} = \begin{cases} 
a_n + n & \text{if } a_n \text{ is odd,} \\
\frac{a_n}{2} & \text{if } a_n \text{ is even.}
\end{cases}\]
Determine the value of \(a_{2023}\).

